#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Name=You might want to send a bug report for this application. Check if it's "
"listed on http://bugs.kde.org, otherwise mail the author. Please include as "
"much information as possible, maybe the original documents. If you have a "
"way to reproduce the error, include this also."
msgstr ""
"Name=ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການສົ່ງລາຍງ"
"ານຄວາມຜິດພາດໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ຂງນກ"
"ະລຸນາລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນຄວາມຜິດພ"
"າດຫລາຍທີ່ສຸດຫລືຫາກທ່ານຈຳວ"
"ິທີທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດ"
"ພາດເຊັ່ນອີກໄດ້ກໍ່ໃຫ້ສົ່ງວ"
"ິທີການນັ້ນມາດ້ວຍ"

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid "Comment=Settings preferred for end users"
msgstr ""
"Comment=ການປັບແຕ່ງສຳຫລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລ"
"ະດັບສູງ"

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGILL signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment=ອັບພລິກເຄເຊິນໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍ"
"ານ SIGILL "
"ໍຊຶ່ງອາດເປັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນອັ"
"ບພລິກເຄເຊິນ"

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid ""
"Comment=An application terminates with a SIGABRT signal when it detects an "
"internal inconsistency caused by a bug in the program."
msgstr ""
"Comment=ອັບພລິກເຄເຊິນຢຸດທຳງານດ້"
"ວຍ SIGABRT "
"ເມື່ອກວດພົບຄວາມຄັດແຍ້ງພາຍ"
"ໃນເນື່ອງຈາກບັກໃນໂປຣແກຣມ"

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGFPE signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment=ອັບພລິກເຄເຊິນໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍ"
"ານ SIGFPE "
"ຈາກບັກພາຍໃນໂປຣແກຣມແລະອັບພ"
"ລິກເຄເຊິນໄດ້ຖາມເພື່ອທຳການ"
"ບັນທຶກເອກະສານຂອງມັນ"

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGSEGV signal due to a bug in "
"the application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment=ອັບພລິກເຄເຊິນໄດ້ຮັບສັນຍ"
"ານ SIGFPE "
"ຈາກບັກພາຍໃນໂປຣແກຣມແລະອັບພ"
"ລິກເຄເຊິນໄດ້ຖາມເພື່ອທຳການ"
"ບັນທຶກເອກະສານຂອງມັນ"

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid "Comment=Sorry, I don't know this signal."
msgstr ""
"Comment=ຂໍອະໄພບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກຫມາຍເລກສ"
